# viewport 1280x800
until 300 REWRITE THE FUTURE
frames 40
save title
click REWRITE THE FUTURE
frames 100
expect The Empty Nursery
save nursery
key KeyD 70
key Space 30
frames 20
save platforming
key KeyP 1
frames 10
expect INTERMISSION
save pause
click FIELD JOURNAL
frames 10
expect Stories in the margins
save journal
